45:09.100 --> 45:11.680
That is a very common, very incorrect assumption.

45:12.000 --> 45:14.360
The brain is absolutely not turned uniformly off.

45:14.760 --> 45:17.380
If you look at an EEG of a patient under propofol,

45:17.700 --> 45:18.800
