45:19.140 --> 45:22.720
There are massive slow-wave oscillations sweeping across the cortex.

45:22.820 --> 45:23.900
So the energy is still there.

45:24.020 --> 45:24.820
The energy is still there.

45:24.880 --> 45:27.620
But what is destroyed is the system's structural stability,

45:28.060 --> 45:30.220
its ability to absorb and manage perturbations.

45:30.220 --> 45:32.880
What does it mean for the brain to manage a perturbation?

45:33.340 --> 45:34.880
In a conscious waking brain,

45:35.320 --> 45:38.200
