looping back

50:56.700 --> 50:57.400
to alter

50:57.400 --> 50:58.640
membrane potentials.

50:58.700 --> 50:59.640
We have rotating

50:59.640 --> 51:00.660
geometric waves

51:00.660 --> 51:01.720
predicting the recovery

51:01.720 --> 51:02.700
of working memory.

51:02.960 --> 51:04.420
We have the catastrophic

51:04.420 --> 51:06.300
destabilization of fields

51:06.300 --> 51:07.440
under anesthesia.

51:07.660 --> 51:08.480
That's a lot of evidence.

51:08.660 --> 51:09.300
But Flyxion,

51:09.840 --> 51:11.200
in a display of almost

51:11.200 --> 51:12.840
painful scientific rigor,

51:13.340 --> 51:14.280
insists we still

51:14.280 --> 51:14.920
have not proven

51:14.920 --> 51:16.720
the ultimate underlying claim

51:16.720 --> 51:17.820
of the field hypothesis.

51:18.020 --> 51:18.720
We have not.

51:19.120 --> 51:19.860
And this brings us

51:19.860 --> 51:20.540
to chapter 8

51:20.540 --> 51:21.140
of the manuscript,

51:21.460 --> 51:22.240
which serves as

51:22.240 --> 51:23.320
the speculative hinge

51:23.320 --> 51:24.340
of the entire endeavor.

51:24.980 --> 51:25.780
The author refuses

51:25.780 --> 51:27.220
to declare premature victory.

51:27.800 --> 51:28.100
Instead,

51:28.260 --> 51:29.300
they establish a strict,

51:29.680 --> 51:30.200
unforgiving,

51:30.340 --> 51:31.500
three-tier evidential test

51:31.500 --> 51:32.300
that must be passed

51:32.300 --> 51:33.780
to conclusively defeat

51:33.780 --> 51:35.060
the recurrent network theory.

51:35.400 --> 51:36.100
Let's lay out

51:36.100 --> 51:36.760
the three tiers.

51:36.980 --> 51:37.800
What is the gauntlet

51:37.800 --> 51:38.780
the field hypothesis

51:38.780 --> 51:39.480
must survive?

51:39.860 --> 51:40.940
Tier 1 requires

51:40.940 --> 51:42.300
that the macroscopic wave

51:42.300 --> 51:43.160
must predict

51:43.160 --> 51:44.320
behavioral outcomes.

51:44.920 --> 51:46.160
We absolutely have this.

51:46.160 --> 51:47.180
the spatial patches

51:47.180 --> 51:49.080
of beta accurately predict

51:49.080 --> 51:50.260
cognitive errors,

51:50.580 --> 51:51.860
and the rotating wave

51:51.860 --> 51:52.860
perfectly predicts

51:52.860 --> 51:53.620
memory recovery

51:53.620 --> 51:55.360
on a trial-by-trial basis.

51:55.680 --> 51:56.740
So Tier 1 is solid.

51:56.900 --> 51:57.860
The exhaust correlates

51:57.860 --> 51:58.860
perfectly with the speed

51:58.860 --> 51:59.300
of the car.

51:59.680 --> 52:01.060
Tier 2 requires proof

52:01.060 --> 52:02.320
that manipulating the waves

52:02.320 --> 52:03.880
causes a measurable change

52:03.880 --> 52:04.520
in the operation

52:04.520 --> 52:05.200
of the network.

52:05.780 --> 52:06.600
We have strong hints

52:06.600 --> 52:07.240
of this through

52:07.240 --> 52:08.060
a phaptic coupling,

52:08.660 --> 52:09.500
showing that applying

52:09.500 --> 52:10.840
external electrical fields

52:10.840 --> 52:12.180
can alter the spike timing

52:12.180 --> 52:13.440
of individual neurons.

52:13.920 --> 52:15.320
But we've not yet proven

52:15.320 --> 52:15.880
that altering

52:15.880 --> 52:16.820
the biological wave

52:16.820 --> 52:17.960
definitively causes

52:17.960 --> 52:20.060
the specific complex operators

52:20.060 --> 52:21.900
like refuse or bind

52:21.900 --> 52:22.860
in a natural setting.

52:22.960 --> 52:23.840
Okay, so Tier 2

52:23.840 --> 52:25.060
is highly plausible,

52:25.480 --> 52:26.280
deeply supported,

52:26.500 --> 52:27.320
but perhaps not

52:27.320 --> 52:28.280
completely closed.

52:28.760 --> 52:29.720
But it's Tier 3

52:29.720 --> 52:31.220
that is the true monster.

52:31.340 --> 52:32.320
Tier 3 requires proof

52:32.320 --> 52:33.260
that the geometric shape

52:33.260 --> 52:34.140
of the wave performs

52:34.140 --> 52:36.040
irreducible computational work

52:36.040 --> 52:37.140
that the underlying

52:37.140 --> 52:38.000
recurrent network

52:38.000 --> 52:39.220
cannot explain on its own.

52:39.320 --> 52:40.140
Irreducible work.

52:40.360 --> 52:40.680
Yes.

52:40.680 --> 52:42.180
This means you must

52:42.180 --> 52:43.260
mathematically prove

52:43.260 --> 52:44.460
that the specific

52:44.460 --> 52:45.480
spatial phase,

52:45.880 --> 52:46.680
the physical shape,

52:46.760 --> 52:47.840
and the propagation direction

52:47.840 --> 52:49.020
of the macroscopic field

52:49.020 --> 52:50.600
are executing data transport

52:50.600 --> 52:52.080
that mere neurons

52:52.080 --> 52:53.380
passing chemical signals

52:53.380 --> 52:54.120
back and forth

52:54.120 --> 52:55.440
cannot account for.

52:55.520 --> 52:56.280
And Flyxion admits

52:56.280 --> 52:57.660
we do not have this.

52:57.940 --> 52:59.380
The author's intellectual honesty

52:59.380 --> 53:00.300
is the strongest part

53:00.300 --> 53:00.760
of the text.

53:01.260 --> 53:02.220
They explicitly state

53:02.220 --> 53:02.880
that Tier 3

53:02.880 --> 53:03.960
remains unachieved.

53:04.680 --> 53:06.360
Despite all the rotating waves

53:06.360 --> 53:07.200
and spatial patches,

53:07.500 --> 53:08.680
we currently cannot

53:08.680 --> 53:09.920
mathematically rule out

53:09.920 --> 53:10.520
the possibility

53:10.520 --> 53:11.660
that the hidden,

53:12.020 --> 53:13.180
incredibly complex,

53:13.340 --> 53:14.340
recurrent connections

53:14.340 --> 53:16.140
between billions of neurons

53:16.140 --> 53:17.560
are doing all the actual

53:17.560 --> 53:18.160
heavy lifting.

53:18.940 --> 53:20.620
And the beautiful geometric waves

53:20.620 --> 53:21.160
we measure

53:21.160 --> 53:23.040
are simply a highly complex,

53:23.300 --> 53:24.680
highly predictive byproduct.

53:25.160 --> 53:25.280
Right.

53:25.340 --> 53:26.700
It is incredibly rare

53:26.700 --> 53:27.260
and refreshing

53:27.260 --> 53:28.480
to read a scientific text

53:28.480 --> 53:29.620
that spends hundreds of pages

53:29.620 --> 53:30.640
building a magnificent,

53:30.920 --> 53:31.560
compelling theory

53:31.560 --> 53:32.760
only to end by saying,

53:32.920 --> 53:34.460
here is my beautiful framework,

53:34.680 --> 53:35.840
and here is exactly

53:35.840 --> 53:37.280
the experiment you need to run

53:37.280 --> 53:38.860
to prove me completely wrong.

53:38.860 --> 53:39.220
Yeah.

53:39.400 --> 53:40.620
So what is the experiment?

53:40.780 --> 53:42.180
How do we finally solve this?

53:42.500 --> 53:43.420
The author outlines

53:43.420 --> 53:44.100
what they call

53:44.100 --> 53:45.560
the decisive experiment.

53:46.080 --> 53:47.460
To definitively prove

53:47.460 --> 53:48.500
the field hypothesis,

53:49.140 --> 53:50.640
scientists must find a way

53:50.640 --> 53:51.780
