53:56.620 --> 53:57.280
of the system.

53:57.540 --> 53:59.020
How would you even do that?

53:59.160 --> 54:00.120
Using advanced,

54:00.240 --> 54:01.460
highly targeted stimulation,

54:02.160 --> 54:03.780
perhaps advanced octogenetics,

54:03.780 --> 54:05.400
or precise transcranial

54:05.400 --> 54:06.460
temporal interference,

54:07.140 --> 54:08.360
you would need to physically

54:08.360 --> 54:09.980
change the spatial phase

54:09.980 --> 54:11.120
gradient of the wave

54:11.120 --> 54:13.420
or force a rotating wave

54:13.420 --> 54:15.280
to reverse its propagation direction.

54:15.340 --> 54:16.200
But here's the catch.

54:16.420 --> 54:17.280
You have to change

54:17.280 --> 54:18.700
the shape of the wave

54:18.700 --> 54:19.400
while holding

54:19.400 --> 54:21.160
the underlying neural population's

54:21.160 --> 54:22.200
overall firing rate

54:22.200 --> 54:23.020
and spectral power

54:23.020 --> 54:24.240
exactly constant.

54:24.320 --> 54:24.820
Precisely.

54:25.120 --> 54:25.920
You must isolate

54:25.920 --> 54:27.220
the geometry from the energy.

54:27.440 --> 54:28.060
You keep the actor

54:28.060 --> 54:29.960
