55:00.280 --> 55:01.540
The geometry didn't matter.

55:02.300 --> 55:03.780
The wave was just beautiful,

55:04.300 --> 55:06.060
complex exhaust all along.

55:06.460 --> 55:07.760
We are quite literally waiting

55:07.760 --> 55:08.500
